                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "DeltaLAI describes the LAI variation over the cycle and is calculated using the Area of Largest Leaf, relative leaf area, plant number, branch number and leaf appearance rate (thermal time/phyllochron).",
                  "Name": "Memo1",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "TotalDMDemand is the new demand added today from the expansion of the size of the organ.  It should be called new DM demand.  If storage was not filled to capacity, total demand will be the new demand plus the deficit\n",
                  "Name": "ReNameRequired",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                }
              ],
